r 30, 2025, the fair value of the Initial and Second Swaps were a liability of $4.6 million, while the fair value of the Third Swap was an asset of $0.1 million, which are reported in other non-current liabilities and other non-current assets, respectively, on the unaudited condensed consolidated balance sheets. The related gains and losses resulting from changes in fair value was losses of $0.04 million and $8.1 million during the three months ended September 30, 2025 and 2024, respectively, and losses of $6.0 million and $2.3 million during the nine months ended September 30, 2025 and 2024, respectively. 16\nEverCommerce Inc.\nNotes to Unaudited Condensed Consolidated Financial Statements\n"}
